<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amgold raises yr shr, div increased.</title>
<headline>Amgold raises yr shr, div increased.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   1,491     vs    1,077</p>
<p>    Shr, net (cts)	  2,250     vs    1,955</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   755     vs    450</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     543     vs    472</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     550     vs    488</p>
<p>    Tax			     7     vs    16</p>
<p>    Interest earned	    41     vs    54</p>
<p>    Turnover		    602     vs    529</p>
<p>Div payable June 6</p>
<p>on register May 2</p>
<p>Full name: Anglo American Gold Investment Company Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
